    <h1 class="display">Who we fund, and how.</h1>
    <p class="section-p">Grants go to 501(c)(3) organizations, not to individuals. We focus on Christian sacred spaces, with room for related work.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
    <div class="stack stack--sm">
      <h2 class="m0">What a grant can pay for</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
